OL,3,GNEWSANext island leader must stay
OL,4,Afocused, advises ex-chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe next leader of the Isle of Man
OL,7,Fgovernment should "stay focused" and
OL,8,F"communicate", according to advice from
OL,9,Fa former chief minister.
OL,11,FMembers of the House of Keys (MHKs)
OL,12,Fwill vote in the lower house on Tuesday
OL,13,Ffor their preferred choice for the
OL,14,Fleadership role, either Kirrie Jenkins
OL,15,For Chris Thomas.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
