OL,3,GNEWSANext island leader must stay
OL,4,Afocused, advises ex-chief
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllan Bell was the island's chief
OL,7,Fminister from 2011 until 2016, when he
OL,8,Fstood down from a 40-year career in
OL,9,Fpolitics. To the next incumbent, he
OL,10,Fsaid: "Listen to everybody, stay
OL,11,Ffocused on your key ambitions" and
OL,12,F"make absolutely sure you communicate
OL,13,Fboth internally and externally".
OL,15,FVoters in 12 constituencies went to the
OL,16,Fpolls on 24 September to elect 24 MHKs
OL,17,Fin the island's general election.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
